      "id": "PR_kwDOL-xLQ88AAAABB6smwg",
      "title": "ci: publish apko images to images/apko registry namespace",
      "author": "falcorocks",
      "number": 732,
      "body": "Repoints the apko image workflow to the `images/apko` Artifact Registry namespace, replacing the previous namespace used by the apko-publish and smoke-test jobs.\n\n- Updates the `registry` input for the apko-publish job.\n- Updates the `registry` input for the smoke-test job.\n\nNo other workflow behavior changes.",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/infra",
      "createdAt": "2026-09-02T15:02:47Z",
      "mergedAt": "2026-09-04T12:10:41Z",
      "additions": 464,
      "deletions": 6
    },
    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOL-xLQ88AAAABCB-ilg",
      "title": "ci: automerge renovate security PRs and run hourly",
      "author": "falcorocks",
      "number": 735,
      "body": "## Summary\n\n- enable automerge for Renovate security PRs via the local config override; the shared preset is CVE-only, so this applies exclusively to vulnerability fixes with green required checks\n- move the Renovate schedule from daily to hourly (staggered minute per repository)\n- `rebaseWhen: behind-base-branch` so stale fix branches refresh themselves instead of waiting on manual rebases\n\n## Context\n\nSame configuration already running in other Project Zero repositories; this closes the advisory-to-fix loop from up to a day to about an hour, with no change for regular version updates (which remain disabled).",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/infra",
      "createdAt": "2026-09-03T09:20:52Z",
      "mergedAt": "2026-09-04T08:56:24Z",
      "additions": 10,
      "deletions": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOL-xLQ88AAAABCLLE0w",
      "title": "ci: run renovate every 4 hours",
      "author": "falcorocks",
      "number": 736,
      "body": "Reduces the Renovate scan cadence from hourly to every 4 hours (staggered minutes preserved). Balances the advisory-to-fix loop against runner cost; security-fix behavior is otherwise unchanged.",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/infra",
      "createdAt": "2026-09-04T09:03:43Z",
